<item><title>Uganda army passes out platoon commanders</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-army-passes-out-platoon-commanders-e27f4f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-army-passes-out-platoon-commanders-e27f4f/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>Officers completed intensive leadership and command training at two military schools.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 06:26:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Six armed men rob Ugandan petrol station of Shs 14m</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/six-armed-men-rob-ugandan-petrol-station-of-shs-14m-abcb5d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/six-armed-men-rob-ugandan-petrol-station-of-shs-14m-abcb5d/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The robbers used a chemical substance to incapacitate four workers before stealing cash, a laptop, and a CCTV device from the Stabex station in Lamwo.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 05:58:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda&apos;s Abuja mission asks diaspora in Nigeria to register</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-s-abuja-mission-asks-diaspora-in-nigeria-to-register-c15453/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-s-abuja-mission-asks-diaspora-in-nigeria-to-register-c15453/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The High Commission wants a database of Ugandans&apos; skills and interests to turn growing trade into investment at home.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:46:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda drivers urge return of speed cameras as road deaths rise</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-drivers-urge-return-of-speed-cameras-as-road-deaths-a5e3d1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-drivers-urge-return-of-speed-cameras-as-road-deaths-a5e3d1/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>Uganda recorded 5,383 road crash deaths in 2025, up from 5,144 the year before, and the government plans to bring back a revised automated enforcement system.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:00:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-drivers-urge-return-of-speed-cameras-as-road-deaths-a5e3d1/share.jpg" length="41950" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-drivers-urge-return-of-speed-cameras-as-road-deaths-a5e3d1/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Kampala traders face rent hike threats for joining URA protest shutdown</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/kampala-traders-face-rent-hike-threats-for-joining-ura-dddd21/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/kampala-traders-face-rent-hike-threats-for-joining-ura-dddd21/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>A warning circulating among traders says shops that open during a planned shutdown against the Uganda Revenue Authority will pay an extra 10 per cent in rent.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:35:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
